From 6b39dd2e901813f24c8931d17977d6d82b944abb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: woahwhattheheck <293286387+woahwhattheheck@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 04:20:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): register camera selector QML in the resource list

Non-deploy builds (just run / cargo build --release) load the UI from the
explicit qrc! list in src/resources_qml.rs. CameraLensSelector.qml and
CameraCatalog.js were not listed, so LensProfile.qml failed with
"CameraLensSelector is not a type" and the main window did not load.
Deploy builds were unaffected because build.rs compiles every file under
src/ui.

Refs #742
---
 src/resources_qml.rs | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/resources_qml.rs b/src/resources_qml.rs
index a7fda49..9086f82 100644
--- a/src/resources_qml.rs
+++ b/src/resources_qml.rs
@@ -28,6 +28,8 @@ qrc!(pub rsrc_qml,
         "src/ui/components/AdvancedSection.qml",
         "src/ui/components/BasicText.qml",
         "src/ui/components/Button.qml",
+        "src/ui/components/CameraCatalog.js",
+        "src/ui/components/CameraLensSelector.qml",
         "src/ui/components/CheckBox.qml",
         "src/ui/components/CheckBoxWithContent.qml",
         "src/ui/components/ComboBox.qml",
-- 
2.43.0

